3 years later however and it feels that people are forgetting what happened . 
So to encourage eyes on this issue I've linked a few articles written at the time;
#UkraineWar #AfricansinUkraine #spéirgorm

How did Dublins 4 councils get so little for local and regional road improvements? For comparison cork city got €11.7m. 

Did the councils drop the ball? Or were they not prioritised? 
